[I] Low-level library for calling build backends of pyproject.toml projects

[T] pyproject-hooks is a low-level Python library for calling the PEP 517
[T] build backends of pyproject.toml based projects, the underlying piece of
[T] tools such as pip and build. It replaces the pep517 project together
[T] with build.

[U] https://github.com/pypa/pyproject-hooks

